MODULE: PinOnlyOnBindingCheckpointLogicalId
TARGET: PinOnlyOnBinding
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the checkpoint reports the GC cursor under the logical source id instead of the bound physical copy (the pre-fix defect)
PERTURBS: Checkpoint

--- FIND
    /\ pinned' = pinned \cup {bound}
    /\ pin' = [pin EXCEPT ![bound] = applied]
--- REPLACE
    /\ pinned' = pinned \cup {Logical}
    /\ pin' = [pin EXCEPT ![Logical] = applied]
--- END
